# The PM-side dayparts (Unicode CLDR 47 Day Period Rules, locale sv --
# eftermiddag [12:00, 18:00), kvall [18:00, 24:00)) doubling as the MERIDIEM
# slot of "atta pa kvallen"/"tre pa eftermiddagen" -- the same daypart-as-
# meridiem reuse es/pt already make for "de la tarde"/"da tarde" (see their
# clock_meridiem_pm.voc).  Surfaces copied verbatim from
# daypart_eftermiddag_sv.voc and daypart_kvall_sv.voc.
eftermiddag
eftermiddagen
kväll
kvall
kvällen
kvallen
